{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15108194","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15108194","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1510819401:0":{"text":"Merlin, your <style=\"highlight\">light wall spell</style> can only stall them for a while. You can't maintain it forever.","source_cn":"梅林，即使是你的<style=highlight>光墙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F3A1DC6C9B8643D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1510819402:0":{"text":"Your precious magic shouldn't be wasted like this.","source_cn":"你宝贵的魔力不该浪费在这种地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F751D7D2DB54169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1510819402":{"text":"Your precious magic shouldn't be wasted like this.","source_cn":"你宝贵的魔力不该浪费在这种地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F751D7D2DB54169","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510819403:0":{"text":"Cute idea. Neither of us is capable of that.","source_cn":"我没那个本事，你也没那个本事。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3FC5B10453FE4142","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Cute idea. Neither of us is capable of that.","female":"Cute idea. Neither of us is capable of that.","variant_male_record_index":"175256","variant_female_record_index":"175257","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510819404:0":{"text":"Morgan's right. As long as someone still wants to fight, the war won't end. No matter how many barriers we raise, they'll be broken sooner or later.","source_cn":"摩根说的没错。只要还有人想战，战争就不会停止。无论我们...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA630E60639D08882","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Morgan's right. As long as someone still wants to fight, the war won't end. No matter how many barriers we raise, they'll be broken sooner or later.","female":"Morgan's right. As long as someone still wants to fight, the war won't end. No matter how many barriers we raise, they'll be broken sooner or later.","variant_male_record_index":"175258","variant_female_record_index":"175259","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510819405:0":{"text":"And with divine blessing on their side, the Wildborn will overwhelm everything in their path.","source_cn":"雅库伯尔人身披狩猎神的加护，一旦双方再度短兵相接，战场...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A3F790F7FB5A91B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510819406:0":{"text":"Not just the border camp, but Halia itself may fall. Those who survive will become prisoners... or corpses.","source_cn":"不止交界的水泽营地，或许连呼临城也会被雅库伯尔占领。走...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD2ACD773700C517","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510819407:0":{"text":"This is the worst-case scenario... and the future we must prevent.","source_cn":"这是最坏的情况……也是我们必须阻止的未来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E2871208CCDC7ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1510819407":{"text":"This is the worst-case scenario... and the future we must prevent.","source_cn":"这是最坏的情况……也是我们必须阻止的未来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E2871208CCDC7ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510819408:0":{"text":"There's only one path left. We must <style=\"highlight\">rescue Perseus</style>.","source_cn":"现在只剩这一条路了……<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x240A50D2584F5D7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510819409:0":{"text":"He's the only one with the authority to stop Halia's army. If even one side lays down arms, we might have a chance.","source_cn":"能阻止呼临军队的，只有他。只要有一方愿意停战，我们就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E990B69230C2F4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510819410:0":{"text":"Rescue him from where exactly? His tomb?","source_cn":"去哪救？坟地？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43A700FB11F137F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1510819410":{"text":"Rescue him from where exactly? His tomb?","source_cn":"去哪救？坟地？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43A700FB11F137F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510819411:0":{"text":"Hah. Maybe not anymore. The Hunting Goddess isn't known for being merciful.","source_cn":"现在未必。那位狩猎神听着不是心慈手软的家伙。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF36027ABCF7B1AE4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hah. Maybe not anymore. The Hunting Goddess isn't known for being merciful.","female":"Hah. Maybe not anymore. The Hunting Goddess isn't known for being merciful.","variant_male_record_index":"175266","variant_female_record_index":"175267","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510819412:0":{"text":"Let's contact Nazrik while the light wall still holds.","source_cn":"用传讯石联络那非吧，趁光墙还能坚持一段时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61569577DC57996B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1510819413:0":{"text":"You use the echo stone and relay the situation to Nazrik...","source_cn":"你们用传讯石联络上那非，将战场上的情况告诉了他……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37A2C8692010C62D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510819414:0":{"text":"At this point, if we want to stabilize this situation and end the war, there's only one last option—<style=\"highlight\">rescue Perseus and help him stop the war</style>.","source_cn":"……此时此刻，再想稳定局势、平息战争，唯有<style...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FF620047A58DBFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510819415:0":{"text":"Nazrik, I ask you once more. Please hunt again, help us find him.","source_cn":"那非，恳请你再次追猎，帮我们找到珀尔修斯的下落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D4B632AC316662D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510819416:0":{"text":"... And why would I do that?","source_cn":"……我为什么要帮你们？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C4E8F9A21920D26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1510819417:0":{"text":"Excuse me?","source_cn":"……啊？<key:dialog51>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE0B06E21E5ECD5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510819418:0":{"text":"I'm a Wildborn. You're asking me to help rescue the general of Halia?","source_cn":"我是雅库伯尔人，帮你们救呼临的统帅……怎么可能？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE23B1CCA8FB5A3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510819419:0":{"text":"Whether Halia stands or burns, it's no concern of mine.","source_cn":"呼临城失不失守，呼临人是死是活，与我无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9E0712BD789D66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:28:1510819419":{"text":"Whether Halia stands or burns, it's no concern of mine.","source_cn":"呼临城失不失守，呼临人是死是活，与我无关。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9E0712BD789D66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1510819420:0":{"text":"No.","source_cn":"不想。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x571BE0B44E5FBB8E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"No.","female":"No.","variant_male_record_index":"175276","variant_female_record_index":"175277","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1510819423:0":{"text":"Halia drew first blood. They invaded us first. We're owed a reckoning.","source_cn":"呼临人侵占雅库伯尔在先，理应受到惩罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x675E63C49C1EAB39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1510819424:0":{"text":"Compared to that... what's a little accusation of treason?","source_cn":"比起正义……被当成叛徒又有什么要紧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93C253F5D7949900","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1510819425:0":{"text":"Your loyalty to the Wildborn is greater than I expected.","source_cn":"那非，你对雅库伯尔的忠心几乎超出我的预料。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x340F1DC9387266B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1510819426:0":{"text":"When we stayed in Glowhaven, you never told us what happened during the Bloodhunt Festival. But as a mage who's traveled far, I've learned a bit about the Wildborn's traditions.","source_cn":"尽管在微光憩居时，你未曾讲述猎血节的始末。但作为一名游...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D1AC700DFBC7BDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1510819427:0":{"text":"I know what that festival entails. How many lives were thrown away to please your goddess, how the best hunters eventually became prey, staining the forest red.","source_cn":"我知道猎血节有多么残酷，知道曾有多少人葬身于这场取悦狩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB5A700144472ECD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1510819428:1":{"text":"Across the lands, there is no deity more insatiable.","source_cn":"放眼整片大陆，没有任何一位神明，如同狩猎神这般嗜血。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF1FD0417684E56E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1510819429:1":{"text":"You saw firsthand how the Arcane Council tried to challenge a god. You know what I'm trying to do.","source_cn":"你亲眼目睹过魔法师协会试图弑神……应当明白我的目的所在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4683BA7F0DEB60A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1510819430:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog60>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC95260DB067F4637","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1510819431:0":{"text":"You want to <style=\"highlight\">kill the Hunting Goddess</style>.","source_cn":"你想<style=highlight>杀了狩猎神</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3990EE64018BF5CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1510819432:0":{"text":"Not for myself. For your people. Just as I pursued the fallen Sarethiel to save Halia, I would do the same here for the Wildborn.","source_cn":"不，不是我想。是为了你，为了雅库伯尔。正如我追逐堕落的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F011826561153C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1510819433:0":{"text":"Tell me, what is the difference between her actions and those of a fallen god? If she's this merciless now, what would become of the Wildborn if she were to fall?","source_cn":"请想想看吧：狩猎神的所作所为与堕神有何区别？她尚未堕落...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BF8D13CFF600EC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1510819434:0":{"text":"If you let it all happen... is that the justice you seek?","source_cn":"默许一切发生，那是你所追寻的正义吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FBA7A6A4BDE3F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1510819435:0":{"text":"Even good intentions, over time, can turn into the worst kind of evil.","source_cn":"主观善行，也会在时间长河中逐渐发酵，最终酿成最大的恶意...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73C027258DF7CD26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1510819436:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"…………<key:dialog17>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x091CD1FB8038143F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1510819437:0":{"text":"Someone promised me the Hunting Goddess would fall.","source_cn":"有人向我保证过，狩猎神终将陨落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A3A99FC1AA8958A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:51:1510819437":{"text":"Someone promised me the Hunting Goddess would fall.","source_cn":"有人向我保证过，狩猎神终将陨落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A3A99FC1AA8958A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1510819438:0":{"text":"My other soul.","source_cn":"我的另一个灵魂。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD7C151E4EC04A0AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"My other soul.","female":"My other soul.","variant_male_record_index":"175295","variant_female_record_index":"175296","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:53:1510819438":{"text":"My other soul.","source_cn":"我的另一个灵魂。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD7C151E4EC04A0AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"My other soul.","female":"My other soul.","variant_male_record_index":"175295","variant_female_record_index":"175296","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1510819439:0":{"text":"A twin soul? Wow, your value just skyrocketed! Quick, spill it. What's going on here?","source_cn":"一体双魂？你的存在价值大大增加了！快，讲清楚，怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD463C7CE0AB8C20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1510819440:0":{"text":"I think I've made my answer clear.","source_cn":"我拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C66296031981561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1510819443:0":{"text":"The real focus here isn't me. It's her, the Hunting Goddess.","source_cn":"重点不在我，而在她，狩猎神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x255FA3BD79E9393F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1510819444:0":{"text":"She ordered the death of countless souls. Devoted followers, her own people.","source_cn":"她授意杀了很多人。那些人都是虔诚的信徒，是她的子民。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE86BEC2C880D5BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1510819445:0":{"text":"If Perseus returns to the battlefield, is there a chance... could you work together to bring her down?","source_cn":"如果让珀尔修斯回到战场，他是不是有可能——你们与他联手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21D054D86CCC6398","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1510819446:0":{"text":"I'll do my best.","source_cn":"我会尽力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A337381CB4E2E84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1510819447:0":{"text":"And if I fail... I'll keep trying, until the day she falls.","source_cn":"即便这次没能成功，我也会继续追逐，直至她陨落的那一刻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F0763708A9ECECD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1510819448:0":{"text":"... Fine.","source_cn":"……好。<key:dialog52>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFABB3274D936DA94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1510819449:0":{"text":"Nazrik vanishes briefly, then reappears, his face shadowed.","source_cn":"那非的身影消失了。片刻后，他再度出现，神情严肃。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1E61872E8C2D285","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1510819450:0":{"text":"... The trail leads to the <style=\"highlight\">Primal Shrine</style>.","source_cn":"……追踪指向<style=highlight>狩猎神殿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x695D583CA23DE7B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1510819451:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">The signal's faint</style>. I can't even confirm it's Perseus. There's interference like last time.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>指示很模糊</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CC9C66F170B880A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:73:1510819451":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">The signal's faint</style>. I can't even confirm it's Perseus. There's interference like last time.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>指示很模糊</style>。我甚至不知道在追踪的是不是珀尔修斯。上次也是一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CC9C66F170B880A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1510819452:0":{"text":"Likely interference from the Hunting Goddess herself. Nazrik's tracking ability comes from her—if she's descending, her presence would obscure his sight.","source_cn":"可能是狩猎神的神力，那非的追猎之能拜她所赐，或许也会受...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x26BB8F592A00623D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Likely interference from the Hunting Goddess herself. Nazrik's tracking ability comes from her—if she's descending, her presence would obscure his sight.","female":"Likely interference from the Hunting Goddess herself. Nazrik's tracking ability comes from her—if she's descending, her presence would obscure his sight.","variant_male_record_index":"175313","variant_female_record_index":"175314","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:78:1510819453:0":{"text":"Hmph. Then it might be a trap.","source_cn":"嗯。可能是陷阱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x938044CBA83797D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:81:1510819454:0":{"text":"Even so, it's our only lead.","source_cn":"也是我们唯一的线索。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA96C0A20A8BF5CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:82:1510819455:1":{"text":"The Arcane Council thanks you, Nazrik. You've given us a direction.","source_cn":"魔法师协会感谢你，那非，你为我们指明了方向。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0B1B2C418581FF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:84:1510819456:0":{"text":"Sacrificing blood and lives to select the \"strongest\", condemning dozens of warriors to death... I never want to witness such a scene again.","source_cn":"以鲜血和生命为祭，为了选拔最强者而断送几十位战士的生命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84065F383B2B9991","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:85:1510819457:0":{"text":"If faith means killing your own to prove your worth, then I want no part of it.","source_cn":"如果只能追随这样的神明，我宁可不要神的庇护。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DA5D11CE381C679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:86:1510819458:0":{"text":"Good luck. Gala's starting to groan again.","source_cn":"祝你们好运。加拉在呻吟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36467D4404FBE843","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:89:1510819459:0":{"text":"Nazrik's image flickers and vanishes.","source_cn":"伴随着一阵人影晃动，你们失去了和那非的联络。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFFDC74B36A410AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:91:1510819460:0":{"text":"If more mortals had his spine, this job would be a lot less miserable.","source_cn":"要是凡人都和他一样，我们的事业会轻松许多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD97A5B298E37B871","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:92:1510819460":{"text":"If more mortals had his spine, this job would be a lot less miserable.","source_cn":"要是凡人都和他一样，我们的事业会轻松许多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD97A5B298E37B871","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:93:1510819461:1":{"text":"I was busy being lazy.","source_cn":"我懒。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC66AA9A019D2EE0D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I was busy being lazy.","female":"I was busy being lazy.","variant_male_record_index":"175323","variant_female_record_index":"175324","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:95:1510819463:0":{"text":"Mortals may never match gods in power—but an idea, a spark... Given time, a spark can become a blade.","source_cn":"凡人不是神明的对手，但思想是一粒火种，迟早会锻烧出利剑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DE99E86EC4BF2B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:96:1510819464:1":{"text":"Let's go. <style=\"highlight\">The Primal Shrine awaits.</style>","source_cn":"走吧，我们<style=highlight>去狩猎神殿...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0405BDDF6DB5D735","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:92:0:1":{"text":"You could've said that earlier.","source_cn":"你怎么不刚才说","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA0B0F1DF3085BF42","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You could've said that earlier.","female":"You could've said that earlier.","variant_male_record_index":"75188","variant_female_record_index":"75189","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:98:1510819462:1":{"text":"... Don't get used to it.","source_cn":"……哼。<key:dialog4>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0798C4C424389EC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:92:1:2":{"text":"Wow, you actually praised someone.","source_cn":"哇，你竟然会夸人","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x25420841096FC8C8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Wow, you actually praised someone.","female":"Wow, you actually praised someone.","variant_male_record_index":"75190","variant_female_record_index":"75191","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:73:0:1":{"text":"Even you can't be sure?","source_cn":"连你也搞不清楚？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x06DB65BBEE05E62F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Even you can't be sure?","female":"Even you can't be sure?","variant_male_record_index":"75184","variant_female_record_index":"75185","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:73:1:2":{"text":"Why is this happening?","source_cn":"为什么会这样？<key:dialog1>","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x95083436EE6707A4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Why is this happening?","female":"Why is this happening?","variant_male_record_index":"75186","variant_female_record_index":"75187","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:53:0:1":{"text":"You really have another soul?!","source_cn":"你真有另一个灵魂？！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2F16F27FC011CCEA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You really have another soul?!","female":"You really have another soul?!","variant_male_record_index":"75182","variant_female_record_index":"75183","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:51:0:1":{"text":"Who?","source_cn":"谁？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0CDE09C626D30454","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Who?","female":"Who?","variant_male_record_index":"77162","variant_female_record_index":"77163","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:101:1510819441:0":{"text":"Hmph. Now you think of me.","source_cn":"哼，这时候想起我了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA3DCF3A1360A823D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Hmph. Now you think of me.","female":"Hmph. Now you think of me.","variant_male_record_index":"175299","variant_female_record_index":"175300","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:102:1510819442:1":{"text":"I don't remember making that promise.","source_cn":"错啦，我可不记得对长角的家伙做过什么保证。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x383C96BDB004D995","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I don't remember making that promise.","female":"I don't remember making that promise.","variant_male_record_index":"175301","variant_female_record_index":"175302","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:51:1:2":{"text":"You've got a big mouth, just like Morgan.","source_cn":"口气真大，和摩根有一拼","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x827D504F383C1086","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You've got a big mouth, just like Morgan.","female":"You've got a big mouth, just like Morgan.","variant_male_record_index":"75180","variant_female_record_index":"75181","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:0:1":{"text":"You'd rather be called a traitor forever?","source_cn":"你想永远背着叛徒的罪名？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE795D05232C468CD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You'd rather be called a traitor forever?","female":"You'd rather be called a traitor forever?","variant_male_record_index":"75174","variant_female_record_index":"75175","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:104:1510819421:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog58>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF678216F7CB0390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:1:2":{"text":"Then you, me, and Gala will be hunted down.","source_cn":"那我和你，还有加拉，都会被追杀！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x28D174FF18C11095","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Then you, me, and Gala will be hunted down.","female":"Then you, me, and Gala will be hunted down.","variant_male_record_index":"75176","variant_female_record_index":"75177","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:105:1510819422:0":{"text":"...","source_cn":"……<key:dialog59>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10287693084A5653","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:28:2:3":{"text":"But you hate the Hunting Goddess!","source_cn":"你讨厌狩猎神，我们是一边的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x6EE5B91B4ECE0D5E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"But you hate the Hunting Goddess!","female":"But you hate the Hunting Goddess!","variant_male_record_index":"75178","variant_female_record_index":"75179","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"Nazrik said he's still alive.","source_cn":"那非刚才说他还活着","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC928DCFACA64BC9C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Nazrik said he's still alive.","female":"Nazrik said he's still alive.","variant_male_record_index":"75170","variant_female_record_index":"75171","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"We can ask Nazrik.","source_cn":"问问那非吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x04DAF34D3650B0AA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We can ask Nazrik.","female":"We can ask Nazrik.","variant_male_record_index":"75172","variant_female_record_index":"75173","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"What do you plan to do?","source_cn":"你打算怎么做？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x57E22B5C503B58BC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What do you plan to do?","female":"What do you plan to do?","variant_male_record_index":"75164","variant_female_record_index":"75165","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"Neither side will agree to a ceasefire.","source_cn":"我不觉得他们能轻易停战","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x55E4F72332275F0E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Neither side will agree to a ceasefire.","female":"Neither side will agree to a ceasefire.","variant_male_record_index":"75166","variant_female_record_index":"75167","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:2:3":{"text":"It'll be mutual annihilation.","source_cn":"战争继续也只会两败俱伤","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xECCE463C64EF1900","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It'll be mutual annihilation.","female":"It'll be mutual annihilation.","variant_male_record_index":"75168","variant_female_record_index":"75169","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"We could take turns?","source_cn":"我们三个轮流来？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD2B6888D840AA64E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We could take turns?","female":"We could take turns?","variant_male_record_index":"75160","variant_female_record_index":"75161","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"What else can be done to stop the war?","source_cn":"还有什么办法能停止战争？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x196E21767081C23C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What else can be done to stop the war?","female":"What else can be done to stop the war?","variant_male_record_index":"75162","variant_female_record_index":"75163","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:摩根":{"text":"Morgan","source":"摩根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"Merlin the First","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:那非":{"text":"Nazrik","source":"那非","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:旁白":{"text":"Narrator","source":"旁白","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":90,"localized_text_count":89,"speaker_count":5}}